  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252fallthemods\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QAUei6a_d.webp?maxwidth=760&fidelity=grand\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"477\"></strong></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>All the Mods</strong>&nbsp;最初只是为我的一些朋友制作的私人整合包，后来却变成了其他玩家也想体验的内容！它包含了大多数“知名”整合包的基础内容，同时还巧妙地融合了一些较新或不太知名的模组。<br><br>本次最大的变化是我们现在使用<strong>NeoForge</strong>，并且基于<strong>1.21</strong>版本。随着新模组的陆续发布，期待会有许多更新！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>在<strong>All the Mods 10</strong>中，我们将延续这一传统，添加许多新模组，同时追求更高的稳定性。</p>\n<p><strong>“All the Mods”真的包含</strong><strong>所有</strong><strong>模组吗？不，当然不是。</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252fallthemods\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nrj9TOe.png\" width=\"748\" height=\"155\"><br><br><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/hALnQl07S7E?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></a></p>\n<p><br><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ftNxcMu0fE0?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span><br><br><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/FvbkI2Zk6Uo?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span><br><br>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><br>&nbsp;<br><br></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XA8ZiUZpJyo\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><br><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/J3J7CLX42\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.ko-fi.com/cdn/kofi2.png?v=3\" alt=\"Buy Me a Coffee at ko-fi.com\" width=\"161\" height=\"41\"></a></p>",
